<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Budget Buddy — Find the software waste hiding in your agency's stack</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,500;8..60,600;8..60,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg: #FAF9F5;
    --surface: #FFFFFF;
    --border: #E6E2D8;
    --ink: #16202B;
    --ink-soft: #5C6570;
    --ink-faint: #8A9099;
    --navy: #1B3A5C;
    --navy-dark: #0E1B2A;
    --navy-dark-soft: #B9C6D4;
    --brass: #A2792C;
    --brass-soft: #F3EBD8;
    --green: #1F6E45;
    --green-soft: #E4F0E8;
    --red: #9C3B2E;
    --red-soft: #F6E7E3;
    --amber: #B8822A;
    --amber-soft: #FBF0DD;
    --radius: 12px;
    --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(22,32,43,0.04), 0 4px 16px rgba(22,32,43,0.05);
  }
  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }
  html{ scroll-behavior:smooth; }
  body{
    margin:0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  .serif{ font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; }
  .mono{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; }
  a{ color:inherit; }
  section{ padding: 88px 32px; }
  .wrap{ max-width:1120px; margin:0 auto; }
  .eyebrow{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; font-size:11.5px; font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:0.07em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--brass);
    background:var(--brass-soft); padding:6px 14px; border-radius:20px;
  }
  h2.section-title{ font-size:34px; font-weight:600; margin:14px 0 12px; letter-spacing:-0.01em; }
  .section-sub{ font-size:16px; color:var(--ink-soft); max-width:640px; line-height:1.6; }
  .center{ text-align:center; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; }

  /* NAV */
  .topbar{
    background: var(--surface); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:16px 32px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:20;
  }
  .brand{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; }
  .brand-mark{ width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:8px; background:var(--navy); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
  .brand-mark svg{ width:17px; height:17px; }
  .brand-name{ font-size:18px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-0.01em; }
  nav.links{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:30px; }
  nav.links a{ font-size:14px; font-weight:500; color:var(--ink-soft); text-decoration:none; }
  nav.links a:hover{ color:var(--navy); }
  .nav-right{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; }
  .btn{ font-family:inherit; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; border-radius:8px; padding:10px 18px; cursor:pointer; border:1px solid transparent; text-decoration:none; display:inline-block; }
  .btn-navy{ background:var(--navy); color:#fff; }
  .btn-ghost{ background:transparent; border-color:var(--border); color:var(--ink); }
  .btn-lg{ padding:14px 26px; font-size:15px; }

  /* HERO */
  .hero{ padding-top:76px; padding-bottom:0; text-align:center; }
  .hero h1{ font-size:52px; line-height:1.12; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-0.02em; margin:22px auto 20px; max-width:820px; }
  .hero h1 .accent{ color:var(--navy); }
  .hero p{ font-size:17.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); max-width:600px; margin:0 auto 34px; line-height:1.6; }
  .hero-ctas{ display:flex; gap:14px; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .hero-note{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-faint); margin-bottom:56px; }

  /* Hero product preview */
  .preview-shell{
    max-width:920px; margin:0 auto; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden;
    border:1px solid var(--border); box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(14,27,42,0.12);
    background:var(--surface); text-align:left;
  }
  .preview-bar{ background:var(--navy-dark); padding:10px 18px; display:flex; gap:6px; }
  .preview-bar span{ width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25); }
  .preview-body{ padding:26px 30px 30px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:20px; }
  .mini-card{ border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:10px; padding:16px 18px; }
  .mini-label{ font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.05em; color:var(--ink-faint); margin-bottom:8px; }
  .mini-value{ font-size:24px; font-weight:600; font-family:'Source Serif 4', serif; }
  .mini-sub{ font-size:12px; color:var(--green); margin-top:4px; font-weight:600; }
  .mini-list{ list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; font-size:12.5px; }
  .mini-list li{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:6px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); }
  .mini-list li:last-child{ border-bottom:none; }
  .mini-flag{ font-size:10px; background:var(--red-soft); color:var(--red); padding:1px 6px; border-radius:5px; margin-left:6px; }

  /* PAIN */
  .pain-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px; margin-top:40px; }
  .pain-card{ background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:24px; }
  .pain-num{ font-family:'Source Serif 4', serif; font-size:30px; color:var(--brass); margin-bottom:10px; }
  .pain-card h3{ font-size:15.5px; margin:0 0 8px; }
  .pain-card p{ font-size:13.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.55; margin:0; }

  /* HOW IT WORKS */
  .steps{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:28px; margin-top:44px; counter-reset:step; }
  .step{ position:relative; padding-left:0; }
  .step-num{
    width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:50%; border:2px solid var(--navy);
    color:var(--navy); font-family:'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight:600; font-size:17px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .step h3{ font-size:16.5px; margin:0 0 8px; }
  .step p{ font-size:13.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.6; margin:0; }
  .step-connector{ position:absolute; top:20px; left:52px; width:calc(100% - 40px); height:2px; background:var(--border); }

  /* FEATURE SHOWCASE */
  .feature-row{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:56px; align-items:center; margin-top:20px; }
  .feature-row:not(:first-of-type){ margin-top:70px; }
  .feature-row.reverse{ direction:rtl; }
  .feature-row.reverse > *{ direction:ltr; }
  .feature-text h3{ font-size:23px; margin:0 0 12px; font-weight:600; }
  .feature-text p{ font-size:14.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.65; margin:0 0 18px; }
  .feature-text ul{ list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; }
  .feature-text ul li{ font-size:13.5px; color:var(--ink); padding-left:20px; position:relative; margin-bottom:9px; }
  .feature-text ul li::before{ content:"✓"; position:absolute; left:0; color:var(--green); font-weight:700; }
  .feature-visual{ background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); box-shadow:var(--shadow); padding:22px; }

  .risk-mini{ display:flex; gap:12px; padding:12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); }
  .risk-mini:last-child{ border-bottom:none; }
  .tier{ flex-shrink:0; width:56px; height:20px; border-radius:5px; font-size:9.5px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
  .tier-high{ background:var(--red-soft); color:var(--red); }
  .tier-med{ background:var(--amber-soft); color:var(--amber); }
  .risk-mini strong{ font-size:13px; display:block; }
  .risk-mini span{ font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-soft); }

  /* PRICING */
  .pricing-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:18px; margin-top:44px; }
  .price-card{ background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:26px 22px; }
  .price-card.featured{ border-color:var(--navy); box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(27,58,92,0.14); position:relative; }
  .price-card.featured::before{
    content:"Most popular"; position:absolute; top:-11px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);
    background:var(--navy); color:#fff; font-size:10.5px; font-weight:700; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:20px; letter-spacing:0.03em;
  }
  .price-name{ font-size:14.5px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:6px; }
  .price-amount{ font-size:32px; font-weight:700; font-family:'Source Serif 4', serif; }
  .price-amount span{ font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:var(--ink-faint); }
  .price-list{ list-style:none; padding:0; margin:20px 0 22px; }
  .price-list li{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); padding:6px 0; padding-left:18px; position:relative; }
  .price-list li::before{ content:"—"; position:absolute; left:0; color:var(--brass); }
  .price-card .btn{ width:100%; text-align:center; }

  /* FINAL CTA */
  .final-cta{ background:var(--navy-dark); border-radius:20px; padding:64px 40px; text-align:center; color:#fff; }
  .final-cta h2{ font-size:32px; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; }
  .final-cta p{ color:var(--navy-dark-soft); font-size:15.5px; max-width:480px; margin:0 auto 28px; line-height:1.6; }

  footer{ padding:36px 32px; text-align:center; font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-faint); border-top:1px solid var(--border); }

  @media (max-width:900px){
    nav.links{ display:none; }
    .hero h1{ font-size:36px; }
    .preview-body{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .pain-grid, .steps, .pricing-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .feature-row, .feature-row.reverse{ grid-template-columns:1fr; direction:ltr; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="brand-mark">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12L9.5 17.5L20 6" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
    </div>
    <div class="brand-name">Budget Buddy</div>
  </div>
  <nav class="links">
    <a href="#how">How it works</a>
    <a href="#finds">What we find</a>
    <a href="#pricing">Get started</a>
  </nav>
  <div class="nav-right">
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-ghost">Log in</a>
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-navy">Start free audit</a>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">◆ Built for marketing &amp; digital agencies</span>
    <h1>Find out exactly what your agency is <span class="accent">wasting money on.</span></h1>
    <p>Upload a transaction export and Budget Buddy audits your software stack in minutes — flagging duplicate tools, unused seats, and price creep, with a dollar figure attached to every finding.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-navy btn-lg">Start free audit</a>
      <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">See Pro features</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-note">No bank connection required — upload a CSV export, get results in under 2 minutes.</div>

    <div class="preview-shell">
      <div class="preview-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      <div class="preview-body">
        <div class="mini-card">
          <div class="mini-label">Recoverable this month</div>
          <div class="mini-value" style="color:var(--brass);">$2,340.00</div>
          <div class="mini-sub">across 2 overlapping tools</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mini-card">
          <div class="mini-label">Stack health score</div>
          <div class="mini-value">82 / 100</div>
          <div class="mini-sub">Strong</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mini-card" style="grid-column: span 2;">
          <div class="mini-label">Flagged subscriptions</div>
          <ul class="mini-list">
            <li>Monday.com <span style="color:var(--ink);">$72.00/mo <span class="mini-flag">overlaps Asana</span></span></li>
            <li>Canva <span style="color:var(--ink);">$14.70/mo <span class="mini-flag">2 unused seats</span></span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PAIN -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center">
      <span class="eyebrow">The problem</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Every agency's software stack quietly grows waste</h2>
      <p class="section-sub center">Tools get added for one project and never cancelled. Seats stay assigned to people who left. Free trials convert to paid. Nobody notices until it's a real number.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pain-grid">
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="pain-num">01</div>
        <h3>Duplicate tools, different teams</h3>
        <p>Design uses Monday, accounts use Asana — nobody realizes you're paying for two project trackers doing the same job.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="pain-num">02</div>
        <h3>Seats nobody's using</h3>
        <p>A contractor rolls off a project and their Canva, Zoom, or Slack seat just keeps billing every month.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="pain-num">03</div>
        <h3>Price creep you never approved</h3>
        <p>Vendors raise prices 8–15% a year quietly. Multiply that across a dozen tools and it adds up fast.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section id="how" style="background:var(--surface); border-top:1px solid var(--border); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">From upload to answer in three steps</h2>
      <p class="section-sub center">No integrations to configure, no sales call required.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-connector"></div>
        <div class="step-num serif">1</div>
        <h3>Upload your transactions</h3>
        <p>Export a CSV from your bank or card provider and drop it in. Budget Buddy never needs live bank access to run an audit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-connector"></div>
        <div class="step-num serif">2</div>
        <h3>We scan for waste</h3>
        <p>Every line item is checked against known vendors, overlapping tool categories, and prior months to catch duplicates, unused seats, and price changes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num serif">3</div>
        <h3>Get a clear audit report</h3>
        <p>See exactly what to cancel, what to renegotiate, and how much it's worth — backed by the transaction evidence behind each finding.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FEATURE SHOWCASE -->
<section id="finds">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center">
      <span class="eyebrow">What we find</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Every finding comes with the receipts</h2>
      <p class="section-sub center">Budget Buddy never guesses — every flagged dollar traces back to a real transaction, so you can act on it with confidence.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-row">
      <div class="feature-text">
        <h3>Risk findings, ranked by severity</h3>
        <p>Not every finding deserves the same urgency. A $150 duplicate subscription and a client that's 40% of your revenue are flagged and sorted differently, so you know what to fix first.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>High / medium / low severity tiers</li>
          <li>Plain-language recommendation on every finding</li>
          <li>Dollar evidence attached, never a vague estimate</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-visual">
        <div class="risk-mini"><span class="tier tier-high">High</span><div><strong>Client concentration risk</strong><span>One client is 42% of recorded revenue.</span></div></div>
        <div class="risk-mini"><span class="tier tier-med">Medium</span><div><strong>Duplicate PM tools</strong><span>Asana and Monday.com both active — $864/yr to consolidate.</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-row reverse">
      <div class="feature-text">
        <h3>A savings number you can actually trust</h3>
        <p>We separate what's <em>possible</em>, what's <em>confirmed</em>, and what's <em>realized</em> — so you never see a number on your dashboard that isn't backed by real evidence.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Potential savings — evidence-based estimate</li>
          <li>Confirmed savings — you've reviewed and agreed</li>
          <li>Realized savings — the charge has actually stopped</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-visual">
        <div class="mini-label">Recoverable spend</div>
        <div class="mini-value" style="color:var(--brass); margin:6px 0 4px;">$2,340.00</div>
        <div class="mini-sub" style="color:var(--ink-faint); font-weight:500;">Potential — nothing cancelled yet</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LOW-KEY PLANS TEASER (full pricing lives on its own page, not the homepage) -->
<section id="pricing" style="background:var(--surface); border-top:1px solid var(--border); padding:64px 32px;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center" style="max-width:560px;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Getting started</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:26px;">Run your first audit free</h2>
      <p class="section-sub center">No credit card, no sales call. See your actual findings before you decide whether a paid plan makes sense — plans start at $0 and scale with how deep you want the audit to go.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:24px; display:flex; gap:14px; justify-content:center; align-items:center;">
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-navy btn-lg">Start free audit</a>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-ghost">Compare plans →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FINAL CTA -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="final-cta">
      <h2 class="serif">Ready to see what's hiding in your stack?</h2>
      <p>Upload a transaction export and get your first audit free — no sales call, no bank connection.</p>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-navy btn-lg">Start free audit</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>© 2026 Budget Buddy · Agency Software Auditor</footer>

</body>
</html>
